{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"国境を越えてから......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なこともおわり、やっと一息つけてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blogの更新が全然できなくてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/26/0596084/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また定期的にちゃんと更新していけるように頑張るので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非checkしていただけたら\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/26/0596084/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/26/0596084/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ?は見てもらえましたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我らがゆみ姉が最後でしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、ゆみ姉のイベント参加がラストだった『似顔絵会』。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井は予定が合わずに、別日となってしまい......；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/26/0596084/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、番組の最後でメッセージなども伝えてましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉とは、ゆっくりとお話も出来ているし、伝えたいことは全て伝えきっているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに書くことは、簡潔に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉 おめでとう!\nゆみ姉 お疲れ様!\nゆみ姉 ありがとう!\nゆみ姉 大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってらっしゃい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、制服のマネキン PVが\n公開になりましたねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クールな感じに仕上がっていましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/26/0596084/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ観ていないという方は\n今すぐcheckしてみてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/26/0596084/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、また更新します〜"}],"source":"archive"}